From: Orbital maintainers
Subject: [PATCH] Separate MangoApp receivers and select explicit app-ready logging

Nested Wayland can supply ready intervals without output intervals. Select one
source for the session, never mix the two streams, and label app-ready logs.
Receive buffers are thread-local and include the SysV message type allocation.
Initialize the queue/logger before either receiver; reject malformed controls.

